      "writtenOn": "2019-12-05T19:29:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The RuleBuilder style is much easier to keep correct because it tracks implicit dependencies simultaneously with the references to them.  If there are testability issues with it I\u0027d suggest investing in fixing them, not going back to static rules.",
      "revId": "c56bd709d43549ccb849b24d162efef227367353",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
